      "conclusion": "SourceContext alignment combines source horizontalAlignment with resolved verticalAlignment. Horizontal leading maps to0 in LTR and1 in RTL. Vertical defaults bottom=1. Service62dbe7c returns center=.5 only when service fields0x60 and0x88 are both nonnil. Fitting target constraints use safe insets each at least10pt, maximum330x420, intrinsic systemLayoutSizeFitting priority50/50 then sizeThatFits then preferredContentSize fallbacks, width floor280 subject to available width. Final origin aligns source and target same normalized anchor and adds source displayOffset. For ordinary bottom-leading this places the target lower leading corner on the source lower leading corner.",
